      "thinking": "Cat-Owl's attack trigger: untap target artifact or creature. My creatures are tapped from attacking. I could untap my Water Tribe Rallier so it's available as a blocker... but opponent has no creatures to attack with (only an uncrewed Airship). Actually untapping Rallier doesn't help much offensively since damage is already being dealt. But wait — if I untap Rallier, it still deals combat damage (it's still attacking). Untapping an attacking creature doesn't remove it from combat. So untap Rallier to have it available as a blocker on their turn? They have no attackers anyway. Alternatively untap Cat-Owl itself — same logic, stays attacking and deals damage, but then it's untapped to block.\n\
