Wait, maybe I'm miscounting lands. bf=[Cat-Owl 3/3 (tapped), Cat-Owl 3/3, Island (tapped), Island (tapped), Island, Island, Plains (tapped)]. That's 5 lands total: 4 Islands + 1 Plains. Untapped: 2 Islands. Plus Rallier (untapped) + one Cat-Owl (untapped) = 4 mana total. Not 5.\n\
