Hmm, but the server says it's playable. Maybe waterbend counts differently — perhaps tapping a creature pays {1} per... Actually maybe the server judges at cheapest and it could fail. But the instructions say choices are confirmed playable. Hmm. Actually, maybe I miscounted — maybe the waterbend cost can be paid partially by tapping, and each tapped permanent pays for {1}. 2+2=4 < 5. So it shouldn't be playable. Unless the untapped Cat-Owl counts... it does. Still 4.\n\
