Wait, maybe Waterbend allows tapping any number and each pays {1}, so max is 4. Odd. But regardless — do I even want to activate it? Activating Rallier's ability now (opponent's turn coming) taps my creatures which I want as blockers? Actually opponent is at 6 with only Long Feng as a creature. I have lethal on board next turn likely: two fliers = 6 damage in the air. Opponent has no fliers (Airship exiled, needs {2} to recast, then crew). \n\
\n\
