      "reasoning": "The board got wiped, but my opponent is at 6 with an empty board and only a ticking Saga. Time to rebuild a clock immediately — Katara comes down now while I have the mana, and I'll hold the Waterbending Lessons for next turn when I can pay the waterbend cost.",
      "thinking": "Current state: Turn 7, my turn, precombat main. I'm at 20, opponent at 6. Board got wiped by The Rise of Sozin chapter I. The Saga is at lore 1; on opponent's next turn it goes to lore 2 (chapter II: choose a card name, search my graveyard/hand/library for up to four cards with that name and exile them). Then chapter III transforms it into Fire Lord Sozin.\n\
\n\
