      "reasoning": "Looking at this combat: they're attacking with everything — Mountain 4/4, Bumi 5/4 trample, Sozin 5/5 menace, Buzzard-Wasp 4/4 flying, Zookeeper 4/4. That's 22 power against my 7 life. Even with optimal blocks (Momo on the flier, Katara on a 4/4), I prevent at most 8 damage and take 14. There's no line that survives — the Sold Out on my First-Time Flyer sealed it. I'll decline blocks and take the loss gracefully.",
      "thinking": "Let me analyze this combat. I'm at 7 life. They're attacking with:\n\
