\n\
If I block two of the attackers (one each), the other three get through: minimum unblocked = 22 - 4 - 4 = 14 if I block two 4/4s. Still way more than 7. I die regardless.\n\
\n\
Wait — can I block Buzzard-Wasp with Momo (flying) and something else with Katara? Best case: block two 4-power creatures, take 5+5+4 = 14. Dead.\n\
\n\
So blocking doesn't matter for survival — I'm dead no matter what. Actually wait, is there any way to survive? No. 22 power incoming, I have 7 life, and I can block at most 2 creatures for 8 damage max (and one of my blockers can only block fliers... Momo has flying so can block Buzzard-Wasp; Katara can't block Buzzard-Wasp since it has flying and Katara doesn't have flying/reach).\n\
\n\
