\n\
So I'm dead this combat no matter what. The game is lost. I should just not block (or block, doesn't matter). Actually, is there any trick? Do I have any mana? All my lands are tapped. My creatures could activate... Katara's waterbend {6} — no mana. Nothing.\n\
\n\
So the game is over. I'll take the loss gracefully. No blocks — actually, let me think: is there any reason to block? No, I'm dead regardless. Just decline blocks and let it end.\n\
\n\
