        "summary": "I attacked with Rallier and both Cat-Owls; they crewed Phoenix Fleet Airship with Long Feng and blocked one Cat-Owl (4/4 vs 3/3 would kill mine). My untap triggers resolved, untapping my attackers. Now I'm casting Airbending Lesson on the Airship: my Cat-Owl stays blocked but survives, they must pay {2} to recast the Airship and crew it again, and I draw a card.",
