        "PilotB - Ability triggers: Bumi, Unleashed - Whenever Bumi, Unleashed deals combat damage to a player, untap all lands you control. After this phase, there is an additional combat phase. Only land creatures can attack during that combat phase.",
      ],
      "pilot_context": {
        "untapped_lands": 1,
      },
      "chosen_args": {
        "summary": "Opponent attacked with Bumi (5/4 trample) and the 4/4 earthbent Mountain. I'm chump-blocking the Mountain with Katara (2/3): it soaks 4 damage (she dies), Bumi still tramples for 5 (me to 15), and crucially the Mountain dies and returns to their side tapped, so it can't attack again in Bumi's extra land-creature combat phase. I keep my Aang/Deserters/Lesson hand to rebuild while they're at 6.",
        "blockers": "p51:p26",
        "rationale": "Chump-blocking the 4/4 Mountain with Katara kills the land creature, which both prevents 4 damage this combat and stops it from attacking in Bumi's extra land-creature combat phase. I'd rather lose Katara than take 9 and face a second combat with a 4/4 while they sit at 6 life.",
      },
