        "summary": "Turn 9 postcombat: I skipped attacking to keep Katara on defense against their incoming lethal board (Bumi 5/4 trample, 4/4 Mountain, Sozin 5/5 menace, Buzzard-Wasp 4/4 flying, Zookeeper 4/4 vs my 7 life). Now casting First-Time Flyer with Momo's discount using Agna Qel'a's blue mana — it enters as a 2/3 flier (two Lessons in graveyard) to give me a second flying blocker for Buzzard-Wasp.",
